[
  {
    "text": "When a man feels unappreciated,",
    "start": 0.0,
    "end": 2.18
  },
  {
    "text": "he doesn't always",
    "start": 2.18,
    "end": 2.72
  },
  {
    "text": "pack a bag and leave.",
    "start": 2.72,
    "end": 4.36
  },
  {
    "text": "Instead,",
    "start": 4.36,
    "end": 4.98
  },
  {
    "text": "he just puts his soul",
    "start": 4.98,
    "end": 5.98
  },
  {
    "text": "on mute.",
    "start": 5.98,
    "end": 6.84
  },
  {
    "text": "He stops repeating himself,",
    "start": 6.84,
    "end": 8.4
  },
  {
    "text": "not because he magically",
    "start": 8.4,
    "end": 9.32
  },
  {
    "text": "ran out of things to say,",
    "start": 9.32,
    "end": 11.1
  },
  {
    "text": "but because he realized",
    "start": 11.1,
    "end": 11.96
  },
  {
    "text": "talking to a brick wall",
    "start": 11.96,
    "end": 13.56
  },
  {
    "text": "is a terrible use of oxygen.",
    "start": 13.56,
    "end": 15.76
  },
  {
    "text": "He stops asking for effort,",
    "start": 15.76,
    "end": 17.3
  },
  {
    "text": "not because he doesn't want it,",
    "start": 17.3,
    "end": 18.62
  },
  {
    "text": "but because begging someone",
    "start": 18.62,
    "end": 19.68
  },
  {
    "text": "for the bare minimum",
    "start": 19.68,
    "end": 20.78
  },
  {
    "text": "is a humiliation ritual",
    "start": 20.78,
    "end": 22.42
  },
  {
    "text": "he's finally too exhausted",
    "start": 22.42,
    "end": 24.02
  },
  {
    "text": "to perform.",
    "start": 24.02,
    "end": 25.14
  },
  {
    "text": "And here's the darkest part.",
    "start": 25.14,
    "end": 26.48
  },
  {
    "text": "When he goes quiet,",
    "start": 26.48,
    "end": 27.46
  },
  {
    "text": "you'll probably think",
    "start": 27.46,
    "end": 28.28
  },
  {
    "text": "everything is fine.",
    "start": 28.28,
    "end": 29.14
  },
  {
    "text": "You'll mistake his silence for peace",
    "start": 29.14,
    "end": 31.08
  },
  {
    "text": "and think, nice,",
    "start": 31.08,
    "end": 32.64
  },
  {
    "text": "we haven't argued in weeks,",
    "start": 32.64,
    "end": 34.06
  },
  {
    "text": "spoiler, he isn't at peace.",
    "start": 34.06,
    "end": 35.94
  },
  {
    "text": "He's just quietly hosting",
    "start": 35.94,
    "end": 37.14
  },
  {
    "text": "a funeral for his feelings",
    "start": 37.14,
    "end": 38.58
  },
  {
    "text": "in his head.",
    "start": 38.58,
    "end": 39.44
  },
  {
    "text": "You don't lose him",
    "start": 39.44,
    "end": 40.12
  },
  {
    "text": "all at once",
    "start": 40.12,
    "end": 40.68
  },
  {
    "text": "in some big dramatic breakup.",
    "start": 40.68,
    "end": 42.84
  },
  {
    "text": "You drain him,",
    "start": 42.84,
    "end": 43.66
  },
  {
    "text": "moment by moment.",
    "start": 43.66,
    "end": 44.96
  },
  {
    "text": "Until one day,",
    "start": 44.96,
    "end": 45.64
  },
  {
    "text": "you look over and realize",
    "start": 45.64,
    "end": 46.92
  },
  {
    "text": "the man who once",
    "start": 46.92,
    "end": 47.98
  },
  {
    "text": "gave you his all",
    "start": 47.98,
    "end": 48.92
  },
  {
    "text": "is now only giving you",
    "start": 48.92,
    "end": 50.4
  },
  {
    "text": "what's left of",
    "start": 50.4,
    "end": 51.2
  },
  {
    "text": "his emotional scraps.",
    "start": 51.2,
    "end": 52.58
  },
  {
    "text": "He stops showing up",
    "start": 52.58,
    "end": 53.48
  },
  {
    "text": "the way he used to,",
    "start": 53.48,
    "end": 54.56
  },
  {
    "text": "the little favors vanish,",
    "start": 54.56,
    "end": 56.06
  },
  {
    "text": "the check-ins dry up,",
    "start": 56.06,
    "end": 57.12
  },
  {
    "text": "and he withdraws quietly",
    "start": 57.12,
    "end": 58.42
  },
  {
    "text": "while the emotional space",
    "start": 58.42,
    "end": 59.86
  },
  {
    "text": "between you",
    "start": 59.86,
    "end": 60.62
  },
  {
    "text": "turns into a canyon.",
    "start": 60.62,
    "end": 62.12
  },
  {
    "text": "His body might still",
    "start": 62.12,
    "end": 63.0
  },
  {
    "text": "be sitting on your couch,",
    "start": 63.0,
    "end": 64.4
  },
  {
    "text": "but make no mistake,",
    "start": 64.4,
    "end": 65.5
  },
  {
    "text": "the version of him",
    "start": 65.5,
    "end": 66.18
  },
  {
    "text": "that actually loved you",
    "start": 66.18,
    "end": 67.44
  },
  {
    "text": "is already dead.",
    "start": 67.44,
    "end": 68.983
  }
]